{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3264b01d-7cb1-83a2-9208-ed59aea8ee97",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:20:08-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:17:51-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:17:55-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Stephen Peckham. Calling about a pothole. Corner near my house. It's been patched three times now and keeps reopening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:03-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three times, okay. Where is the intersection, Mr. Peckham?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:07-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 143 Narragansett Avenue. Hole is right at the corner there, where the side street comes in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:14-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "143 Narragansett Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. And do you know the name of the side street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:20-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, um, it's the one right by the mailbox. Honestly I'd say just look at my address. Corner is maybe fifty feet from my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:29-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll note it by your address, fifty feet or so from the driveway. When did the last patch go in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:37-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Couple weeks back. Cold patch, I think. Held until the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago. Then it opened up again. Bigger now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:46-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that rain does it. The water gets under the patch and pushes it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:52-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense. Neighbor hit it too. Guy across the street. Blew a tire, I think, Sunday night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:18:58-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. I'll put in the report that a vehicle hit it. Did he report it to us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:06-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not sure. Don't think so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:09-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. He can call us too, and he could ask about a damage claim form. That's separate from your report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:16-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, you want me to call back? About the claim?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:20-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I said your neighbor can call. You don't need to do anything else. I've got your report here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:27-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Got it. Misheard. Okay, I'll tell him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:30-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:33-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, how long do repairs usually take? Just so I know what to expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:38-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. After a wet weekend the crews have a long list, so it could be a few days or longer. A more permanent fix usually waits on warmer weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:48-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's about what I figured."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:51-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read it back. Pothole at the intersection near 143 Narragansett Avenue, patched three times, reopened after the weekend rain, one vehicle damaged. Is a callback number 401-555-0190?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:01-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:03-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set. Thanks for calling, Mr. Peckham."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:06-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Lorraine. Bye."
    }
  ],
